Description: Desktop idle blockers and screensaver status for KDE Plasma
 A session service and system-tray widget show effective idle inhibitors,
 screensaver status, lock and sleep blockers, and recent blocking history.
 The optional native KWin bridge supplies exact window attribution.

Package: desktop-idle-status-kwin-bridge
Architecture: linux-any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 libkwin6 (>= ${kwin:Version})
Description: Native KWin idle-inhibitor bridge for Desktop Idle Status
 This plugin runs inside KWin and exposes its effective and latent Wayland
 idle inhibitors to Desktop Idle Status over the session bus. It loads at
 the next login. KWin refuses a plugin built for a different upstream
 version; a rebuild is required after a KWin upstream update.
 .
 Kill switch: kwriteconfig6 --file kwinrc --group Plugins
 --key desktopidlestatusbridgeEnabled false
 (takes effect at the next login; does not unload a running plugin).
